<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80155" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάχος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παχύς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thickness</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόσσον
				ἔην μῆκος τόσσον π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.324
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ἔχοι π. ἔχοι ἂν μόρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Meliss.
					9
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. τοῦ τείχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.93
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πλίνθου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.20
				</span></i>
			 : pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. τῶν τριχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					517b8
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π</span>. 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτῶν ἐκμυελιεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Nu.</u>
					24.8
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκήνεια ὀρθὰ καὶ πάχη ἔχοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					353.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span> : abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάχος</span>
			<i>in thickness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.372.11
			</span></i> ; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάχει μάκει τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.245
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρκὸς π</span>. <i>stoutness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				380
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ πάχος τοῦ σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					19
				</span></i>
			 ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτότης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				523e
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>consistency, thickness</i>, of liquids or fluids, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				441a29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				739a12
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. τῆς θαλάσσης</span>,
			attributed to its saltness, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				359a7
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥστε γίνεσθαι τὸ π. ὡς κυκεῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					89.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in concrete
			sense, <i>thick mass</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.18
			</span></i>.</div>
